{{! Field names are placeholders until the screen contract names the countdown widget's fields. }}
{{! percent_step: share of the wait already passed, 0-100 in steps of 5 (a template cannot set a width,
    so the CSS maps each step class to one); remaining_text carries the same news in words. }}
<h2 class="canccu-widget__title">{{title}}</h2>
<div class="t-count">
  <p class="t-count__label">{{label}}</p>
  <p class="t-count__remaining">{{remaining_text}}</p>
  <div class="t-xp t-xp--hero" aria-hidden="true"><span class="t-xp__fill t-xp__fill--{{percent_step}}"></span></div>
  <p class="t-count__foot"><span>{{target_text}}</span> <span class="t-count__pct">{{percent_text}}</span></p>
</div>
